# Cloud-Native API Gateway in C#

Below is a comprehensive implementation of a modular Cloud-Native API Gateway in C# that meets your requirements. This solution uses ASP.NET Core for the core framework and integrates several key components.

## Solution Architecture

```
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                Cloud-Native API Gateway               │
├───────────────┬───────────────┬───────────────────────┤
│ Reverse Proxy │ JWT Auth     │ Distributed Tracing   │
│ Forwarder     │ & Authorization│ Middleware          │
└───────────────┴───────────────┴───────────────────────┘
```

